 "remarks": "Welcome to 50 Creeping Hemlock Drive, where comfort, flexibility, and convenience come together! This inviting home offers versatile living spaces designed to adapt to today's lifestyle, whether you need room for family, guests, work, or simply more space to enjoy. One of the most exciting features is the additional fourth living space, set up as an ADU, creating endless possibilities. Use it for extended family, a private guest area, home office, recreation space, or explore the potential for additional rental income. Conveniently located near shopping, restaurants, everyday amenities, and major highways, this home makes commuting and daily life easy while still giving you the space and flexibility you've been looking for. If you're searching for a property that offers more than just a place to live, 50 Creeping Hemlock Drive is full of possibilities. Come experience the space, versatility, and potential this home has to offer!",
